{"sourceUrl":"https://yyyl.swu.edu.cn/info/1068/4215.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:31.490642+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yyyl.swu.edu.cn/info/1068/4215.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为做好</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>推荐</span></span><span><span>免</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>初</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，</span></span><span><span>我院将开展</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推免生预报名工作</span></span><span><span>，欢迎</span></span><span><span>广大</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二）</span></span><span><span>具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>研究兴趣浓厚、有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）</span></span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院在</span></span><span><span>“西南大学202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>可选报的</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>最终以</span><span>“教育部推免服务系统”填报专业为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名和复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1、报名时间：2025年9月5日至2025年9月16日（17:00前）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>  2、</span></span><span><span>凡符合上述</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请</span></span><span><span>于报名时间内</span></span><span><span>登录</span><span>“西南大学202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”（http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/），</span></span><span><span>按要求上传相关电子材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关电子材料如下（均为原件扫描的</span><span>pdf格式）：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）本人学生证（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）第二代身份证（正反面）（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）加盖本科学校教务处公章的“在校历年学习成绩表”；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）本人详细简历（包括本科专业背景、学习科研情况等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5）所在高校的推免资格证明（如所在学校尚未公示推免资格，可暂不提交，在推免复试前补交）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6）（如果有）国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>7）（如果有）</span></span><span><span>代表性</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>成果</span></span><span><span>（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>8）（如果有）获奖证书或专利证书（复试提供原件）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>9）作品集、原创性工作成果等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：上传文件按照顺序扫描或合并成1个pdf文件且大小不要超过8M。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、预推免进群</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为方便联系和通知，请拟申请我院</span><span>2026级推免生的同学加入QQ群：</span></span><span>1027066962</span><span><span>（进群请修改备注名为：本科学校</span><span>+姓名+报考专业）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>将对</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span></span><span><span>，择优确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关注</span></span><span><span>“西南大学202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>站内消息并保持手机畅通。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、复试时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预计</span></span><span><span>2025年9月18日，具体时间、地点以最终通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、</span></span><span><span>复试方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>线下综合面试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、复试内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括思想道德水平考核、外语水平测试、专业素养考核、科研潜力、综合素质考核、心理健康状态检查等内容，满分为</span><span>100分。复试分数低于60分为不合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>西南大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”注册并填报志愿，按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>具体流程如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、通过预推免复试的推免生在推免系统开通的24小时内登录中国研招网“全国推免生服务系统”填报志愿。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、学院通过中国研招网“全国推免生服务系统”发复试通知，推免生接收复试通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、学院通过研招网发待录取通知，推免生接收待录取。推免生接收工作结束。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>特别提醒：</span></span></strong><span>通过复试的推免生</span><span>须按要求及时在中国研招网接收待录取通知，未在规定时间内接收待录取视为自动放弃我院拟录取资格，拟录取资格由排名靠后的同学依次递补。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>“全国推免服务系统”网址为：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/，预计9月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和我</span></span><span><span>院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生</span></span><span><span>章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）</span></span><span><span>未进行预报名的考生，也可在</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>研招网</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”开通后进行报名。我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以</span></span><span><span>实时</span></span><span><span>通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、接收推免工作联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：刘老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>023-68251037</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>544</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>8@</span></span><span><span>qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：西南大学第</span><span>33教学楼410室（教学工作办公室）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>                                                 园艺园林学院</span>     </span></p>\n<p><span><span>                                                 2025年9月1日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"da680f97d9524b40f2746d4f6fd04d23becc9dce50adf453c83a7d05bc6f6052","textLength":1734,"sourceSha256":"48d2a5bbbd6759734bde28faff3393906c021e85831cc2cb82a420481c6fa3fc","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1.西南大学2026年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx","url":"https://yyyl.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1821560868&wbfileid=697D59E9731AD6D941A446D1AA802E81"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-96832c44f81bbe3b4a75","title":"2025年西南大学园艺园林学院关于接收2026年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:31.490642+00:00"}
